    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jeacheenga Isakari",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Isakari: Dola gil, ea Buwa, ea Yashubu, ea Shimroni, saawa ea ang'wan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Dola: Usi gil, ea Refaya, ea Yerieli, ea Yamai, ea Ibsamu, ea Shemueli, ea fuga hees bea dooshta ghweaniga nyaawa, was fuga gheeh Dola, fuga meanyi bea ng'ucheeda aba jeeda jeacheenga nyaawa, nea mooneeda nyaawa aba damanda Dawdi ea sagalamnyooji diktam ea iyeenya ea bughalaji lah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Usi: Israhiyahi. Nea orjooga Israhiya: ea Mikaeli gil, ea Obadiya, ea Yoeli, ea Ishiya, saawa ea muut, ak saawa ea headiga was sugoodiga; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "eara aba jeedeaba fiisu, abeeda gwanda fuga ng'ucheeda hita fih sagalamnyooji diktam ea damwalah, aba gideaba gwandeawa gadeemga saang'a ea orjooga. Suh geang'oar aba gidabeeda dooshinga nyaawa ea gealga ghweaniga nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea buweadeega nyaawa gaba dooshinga sean bea Isakari ea fuga ng'weani aba ng'ucheeda nea aba jeacheenga nyaawa iisiyiida ghwahita sean fih sagalamnyooji seedam ea ispwa was fuga ammu ng'ucheeda iisiyiida aba jeacheenga nyaawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jeacheenga Benjamini ea Dani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Benjamini: Bela gil, ea Bekeri ea Yediya-eli, saawa ea samwagu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Bela: Esboni gil, ea Usi, ea Usieli, ea Yeremoti, sea Iri, saawa ea muut, nea saawa ea fuga hees aba gealga nyaawa, ak ea meanyi aba ng'ucheeda; nea iising'waar aba gidabeada jeacheenga nyaawa ea sagalamnyooji diktam ea iyeenya ea diktam ea damanang'wan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Bekeri: Semira gil, ea Yoashi, ea Elieseri, ea Elioenayi, ea Omri, ea Yeremoti, ea Abiya, ea Anatoti, ea Alemeti. Suh seaniin orjooga Bekeri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geeyiida aba gidabeada jeacheenga nyaawa aba gidabeada seaygoojiga nyaawa, saawa fuga hees aba gealga nyaawa, was fuga meanyi aba ng'ucheeda, hita sagalamnyooji diktam ea bughalaji iyeenya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Yediya-eli: Bilhani gil. Orjooga Bilhani: Yeushi gil, ea Benjamini, ea Ehudi, ea Genaana, ea Setani, ea Darshishi ea Ahishahari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fiisu seaniin orjooga Yediya-eli aba gidabeada fuga hees bea gealga nyaawa, fuga meanyi aba ng'ucheeda, was fih sagalamnyooji damanispwa ea bughalaji iyeenya, hideadi aba gadiyeeda ng'ucheeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea Shupimu ea Hupimu ea orjooga Iri, nea Hushimu ea orjeeda Aheri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jeacheenga Naftali",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Naftali: Yasieli gil, ea Guni, ea Yeseri ea Shilemu, was diibiga Bilha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jeacheenga Manase",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Manase: Asrieli gil, ghayi jih gwealeadaanyi bea eemeeda Arami; ak gwaji eara Makiri was ghweanda Gileyadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gageesheesa Makiri Hupimu ea Shupimu. Nea gheawunga huda ghaamwat geeguura Maaka. Nea gheawunga orjeedeaba iyeenya geeguura Selofehadi; ak gwandeawa Selofehadi haweega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwaji Maaka was gatmooda Makiri baleanda, ak geeguura gheawungaaschi Bereshi; nea gheawunga orjeeda ghaamwat geeguura Shereshi; nea orjoagaaschi geeguura Ulamu ea Rakemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjeeda Ulamu: Bedani. Suh orjooga Gileyadi was orjeeda makiri, orjeeda Manaseehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak huda ghaamwat siguura Hamoleketi gwaji Ishodi, ea Abieseri sea Mala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Shemida Ahiyani gil ea Shekemu, ea Liki sea Aniamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jeacheenga Efraimu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Efraimu: Shutela gil, ak gwaji orjeedaanyi siguura Beredi, nea orjeedaanyi ea Dahati, nea orjeedaanyi ea Eleyada, nea orjeedaanyi nih ea Dahati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gwaji orjeedaanyi siguura Sabadi, ak gwaji orjeedaanyi siguura Shutela, ea Eseri sea Eleadi, ghayi bwar fuga Gati was fuga bea ng'eanyiida aba gideaba ghwararang'aan ghoareat dugwa nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gagiisan Efraimu was ghweanda nyaawa askwearjoojiga saang'a, ak ghapka orjooga ghaamwat ak gageandeawa giiseaneega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amang'ata gawa Efraimu heeda gatmoadaanyi, ak gagweayiit ak gwaji baleanda; ak gaguura gheawungaaschi Beriya, aba gideaba niibisa gheanyi ng'asheega munyas mida jeedeaba gheanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea hudaanyi geeguura Shera, ghayi deas mujiinajeega Bet-horoni heeda hiing'aada ea heetiyeada, ea Usen-sheera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjeedaanyi geeguura Refa, ak gwaji orjeedaanyi siguura Reshefu, ak gwaji orjeedaanyi siguura Dela, ak gwaji orjeedaanyi siguura Dahani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gwaji orjeedaanyi siguura Ladani, ak gwaji orjeedaanyi siguura Amihudi, ak gwaji orjeedaanyi siguura Elishama, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gwaji orjeedaanyi siguura Nuni, ak gwaji orjeedaanyi siguura Yoshuwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea darooraka was giibinda nyaawa ambal ea Beteli gil ea mujiinajeagaaschi, nea aba heeda ghayeawa ea Nara nea aba heeda biyeara ea Geseri gil ea mujiinajeagaaschi, Shekemu ea mujiinajeagaaschi, ea Aya sea mujiinajeagaaschi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea ghoah moonghajeega eemeeda Manase, Bet-sheani ea mujiinajeagaaschi, ea Daanaki ea mujiinajeagaaschi, ea Megido ea mujiinajeagaaschi, ea Dori ea mujiinajeagaaschi. Nea jeedeaba darooraksu ea heeda abiita jeacheenga Yosefu gil was orjeeda Israeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jeacheenga Asheri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Asheri: Imna gil, ea Ishfa, ea Ishfi, ea Beriya sea huda ghaamwat siguura Sera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Beriya: Heberi gil, ea Milkieli, was ghweanda Birsaiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak Heberi gwaji Yafleti, ea Shomeri, ea Hotamu, ea huda ghaamwat siguura Shua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Yafleti: Basaki gil, ea Bimhali, sea Ashfati. Suh orjooga Yafleti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Shemeri was orjeeda ghaamwat: Sofa gil, ea Yehuba sea Aramu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Helemu was orjeeda ghaamwat: Sofa gil, ea Imna ea Sheleshi, sea Amali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Sofa: Suwa gil, ea Harneferi, ea Shuali, ea Beri, ea Imra, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea Beseri, ea Hodu, ea Shama, ea Shilsha, ea Itrani sea Bera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Yeteri: Yefune gil, ea Bispa, ea Ara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Ula: Ara gil, ea Hanieli sea Risiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fiisu seaniin gaba Asheri, was fuga hees bea gheanyaawa, ghayi sigwalu, meanyi aba ng'ucheeda, mida madeeda was fuga hees mida madeedeaba suurja. Nea mooneeda nyaawa geang'waar aba gidabeada jeacheenga nyaawa, aba gadiyeeda ng'ucheeda, buuneeda ea sagalamnyooji diktam ea lah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
